  hintId: tutorial_hub
  isUnlockedByDefault: 1
  ignoreLock: 0
  title: The Hub Area
  image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8a30f7041ca6df44f9f6a6cafc1f798f, type: 3}
  description: '<b>Main Hub</b>


    The Main Hub is the central area where you
    manage exploration, upgrades, and ship recovery.


    From the Hub, you can
    access exploration levels, puzzle levels, upgrades, tutorials, and stored information
    gathered during your journey.


    Collected resources are brought back to the
    Hub and can be used to unlock technologies, improve systems, and repair the ship.


    As
    progress is made, additional systems and functionalities within the Hub will
    gradually become available.'
  isImageBig: 0
